  X[3, :, 0]  # Solution to the linear system A[3, :, :] x = RHS[3, :, 0]

  # Solve five linear systems (K = 5) for every member of the length 10 batch.
  A = ... # shape 10 x 2 x 2
  RHS = ... # shape 10 x 2 x 5
  ...
  X[3, :, 2]  # Solution to the linear system A[3, :, :] x = RHS[3, :, 2]
  ```

